    detailsTitle: "How we move a Squarespace site safely.", detailsIntro: "The export is a starting point, not a copy. Squarespace's own help page lists what it leaves out, so we check every page against the live site before your domain moves. Every build also includes our AI-search setup: answer-first pages, structured data and an llms.txt file for AI tools.",
