    priceTitle: "Squarespace website design and migration cost.", price: "From $1,500", priceCopy: "Starter, from $1,500, covers up to 7 pages. Growth, from $3,500, covers 8 to 20 pages with full migration and a redirect map. Scale starts at $5,000. For comparison, Squarespace lists its plans at $19 to $99 a month billed yearly. Your proposal puts both running costs side by side.",
